  32:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****     (#) Declare a SAI_HandleTypeDef handle structure (eg. SAI_HandleTypeDef hsai).
  33:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****     (#) Initialize the SAI low level resources by implementing the HAL_SAI_MspInit() API:
  34:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****         (##) Enable the SAI interface clock.
  35:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****         (##) SAI pins configuration:
  36:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****             (+++) Enable the clock for the SAI GPIOs.
  37:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****             (+++) Configure these SAI pins as alternate function pull-up.
  38:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****         (##) NVIC configuration if you need to use interrupt process (HAL_SAI_Transmit_IT()
  39:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****              and HAL_SAI_Receive_IT() APIs):
  40:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****             (+++) Configure the SAI interrupt priority.
  41:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****             (+++) Enable the NVIC SAI IRQ handle.
  42:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c **** 
