  44:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****              and HAL_SAI_Receive_DMA() APIs):
  45:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****             (+++) Declare a DMA handle structure for the Tx/Rx stream.
  46:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****             (+++) Enable the DMAx interface clock.
  47:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****             (+++) Configure the declared DMA handle structure with the required Tx/Rx parameters.
  48:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****             (+++) Configure the DMA Tx/Rx Stream.
  49:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****             (+++) Associate the initialized DMA handle to the SAI DMA Tx/Rx handle.
  50:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****             (+++) Configure the priority and enable the NVIC for the transfer complete interrupt on
  51:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****                 DMA Tx/Rx Stream.
