  54:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****         (##) Expert mode : Initialize the structures Init, FrameInit and SlotInit and call HAL_SAI_
  55:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****         (##) Simplified mode : Initialize the high part of Init Structure and call HAL_SAI_InitProt
