 293:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) Call the function HAL_SAI_Init() to configure the selected device with
 294:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****           the selected configuration:
 295:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****         (++) Mode (Master/slave TX/RX)
 296:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****         (++) Protocol
 297:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****         (++) Data Size
 298:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****         (++) MCLK Output
 299:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****         (++) Audio frequency
 300:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****         (++) FIFO Threshold
 301:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****         (++) Frame Config
 302:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****         (++) Slot Config
