 304:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) Call the function HAL_SAI_DeInit() to restore the default configuration
 305:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_sai.c ****           of the selected SAI peripheral.
